The Go packages in this repository are generated from formal ASN.1
definitions published in third-party specifications, including those of the
3GPP Organizational Partners (ARIB, ATIS, CCSA, ETSI, TSDSI, TTA, TTC), ITU-T,
the GSM Association (GSMA) and the IETF. Those specifications remain the
property of their respective copyright holders and are subject to their
terms of use. README.md names the specification editions used for each
generated package. Source content hashes are recorded in release-evidence.json
for the packages it lists, and in the RELEASE-EVIDENCE.json files beside the
TCAP and GSM MAP packages.
